{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If you find an object: approach, grab and check for properties. If not visible: move and scan area. list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Action ID = MoveToFindObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckProperties    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    />\"",
